  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> essence pool, either spherecaster level 1 or manifester level 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> At the end of your turn, for every 2 power points or 1 spell point you have spent since the end of your last turn, you may reallocate 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
